  "sourceTitle": "IBM releases SOTA Granite Time Series PatchTST-FM-r2 model with commercial-friendly license",
  "sourceBodyHash": "89e5c51aed3ac737af435392caea6a67ac6d307b8df49161b3a2b0f2d103e453",
